NeoRider patch 0005 on top of 0001-0004 (gosh-sh/bee-engine v6.0.0, commit 015bc466613e7b7c41f272dc16ba0cacbf0e4d93).
- GPU assist: tap_params() returns {seed,index,complexity} of the next tap leaf (JSON); add_tap_nonce(x, y, now_ms, nonce_lo, nonce_hi) queues a tap with the timestamp and nonce found outside the engine (WebGPU).
- The engine computes and checks that leaf exactly like its own search; if the nonce does not meet the target it falls back to the normal CPU search. tap_computed reports "gpu": true/false.
License: AGPL-3.0-only (same as upstream).

